&lt;p data-start=&quot;2048&quot; data-end=&quot;2225&quot;&gt;Expert discovery &amp;amp; qualification skills: Demonstrated ability to apply MEDDPICC or equivalent frameworks to drive disciplined pipeline and eliminate low-probability deals.&lt;/p&gt;
