&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you ready to accelerate your sales career at&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Elastic, the Search AI company&lt;/strong&gt;?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Sales Development Representative (SDR) at Elastic, you&#39;ll play a key role in driving our continued growth by engaging prospective customers, understanding their business challenges, and creating high-quality opportunities that fuel our sales pipeline. Working closely with Account Executives and Marketing, you&#39;ll identify the right prospects, spark meaningful conversations, and help organizations discover how Elastic&#39;s platform can solve their most critical business challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;ve built a collaborative workspace for Korea, where teamwork, continuous learning, and career development are at the heart of everything we do. We believe that drive, curiosity, and coachability are the foundations of long-term success. If you&#39;re eager to learn, embrace feedback, and make an impact, we&#39;d love to meet you. &lt;strong&gt;This person should be based in Singapore&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner for Success:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate closely with your Account Executives and Marketing to identify target accounts, execute strategic campaigns, and generate high-quality pipeline across your territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prospecting:&lt;/strong&gt; Prospect into strategic Korean accounts through a combination of phone, email, social selling, events, and other outbound channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create Meaningful Conversations:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Engage inbound and outbound prospects through a thoughtful multi-channel approach. Ask great questions, uncover business challenges, and qualify opportunities that create value for both the customer and our sales teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage Technology:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Use LinkedIn Sales Navigator, Demandbase, Sumble, AI-powered tools, and other sales technologies to research accounts, identify key decision-makers, personalize your outreach, and maximize your effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Become an Elastic Expert:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Develop a strong understanding of the Elastic platform, our AI-powered solutions, and the industries we serve so you can confidently articulate business value and connect customer challenges with the right solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn, Grow, and Own Your Development:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Take ownership of your growth by embracing coaching, continuous feedback, and ongoing enablement. You&#39;ll work alongside experienced colleagues who are invested in helping you build a successful long-term career at Elastic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
