&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales, Sales Development, or customer-facing experience is a plus, but not a requirement. We&#39;re equally excited to meet ambitious early-career professionals who are eager to build a career in sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong drive to succeed and a genuine desire to build a successful career in sales.&lt;/li&gt;
