&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and a passion for understanding technology, customer challenges, and how businesses grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills with the ability to engage prospects confidently through phone, email, LinkedIn, and other digital channels.&lt;/li&gt;
