&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating fast-paced, high-growth environments characterized by rapid organizational restructuring or frequent Mergers &amp;amp; Acquisitions (M&amp;amp;A).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in setting up a Data Mesh or federated data architecture in a hybrid or multi-cloud environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active engagement or understanding of integrating AI/ML infrastructure readiness into core enterprise data platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
