&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;9uof3-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;9uof3-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Data Fluency:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;9uof3-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; Solid proficiency utilizing SQL or Business Intelligence tools to dissect, clear, and transform unstructured billing data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
